<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-18T16:02:14.126Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:02:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has carried out a drone strike on a livestock market, killing civilians, and another strike in West Kordofan that killed four civilians. RSF drones have hit an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan and a gold-mining area on the Egypt border, causing civilian casualties. The army also claims to have killed dozens of RSF fighters in an attack on Nyala. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/18/sudan-army-accused-of-drone-strike-on-livestock-market?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1DdVo0cVRncXRWb0Q0Y3dvM0QxZEtFZGd4eFQwRUQwTllWZDBjZ0FYMkpHdGNKNUw3ZnZkRnoxOFVZUWdFU3N2T0JpOWV4TUpKVE5RVDFRWnlEZ9IBX0FVX3lxTE84YkRGMTBGYkdwNmszTGJnMURCN1pCZTJOWHYyTGFVQ21JbHdyQnVSUE5OMS1ySHJMSTJlYmhnaFFQV2xDcXNiNE9SUndNUDZuRk01TXRQaURHRmVET2pJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE1zQ0c1dU5jLThnaXFSa3Z0ajMzOXAxRHJkRFYxQldfZUd2enRUUjZGWlVraVpoNG9PNjZBX0hteklTZ0Q0SGtOT0J5dUVSX1JvNC11LU9MeUJzcERBdzVZalZ1MHZDTTDSAVxBVV95cUxNSjhibGRSUHdfYUFNMXVlcnk5MFRWdUJhLUpfbm9HRjk4WFVaQk9fbHpWbzctdVkxTTJVVDJVMVdnM2ZOY0NvdHJUenA4bGhjeGpwMHFqd2NyekNzTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE1yX0kzd0FnTDg2T2plWFdLNFFaS1ctLXFJVlRrWVloYjdkanc5NnJmZ29SVDgwMW9nWWNTTkNEeGcxN3JMM1JvZWpVZDFxOGtScnYxVkNrcEtCMmN6NW9BdVdxb0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNQVk0dUdqS2FQdnVQd3N1VWpQTmVEclVzd05hSHBuNnZHSUxFSH